o the Certification Office by the Superintendent only, if a waiver is required to hire a teacher who is ineligible for a certificate.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certification%20-%202025-2026%20Certificate%20Endorsement%20List%20.pdf\">List of Certificate Endorsement Codes and Levels</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certification%20-%20Blank%20Upgrade%20sheet%20-%201.22.2025.xlsx\">Ed Tech Upgrade Form</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Excel</span> Fill out and send in this form with Application ET Upgrade</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Teacher%20Rubric-%20Word%20%28002%29_1.pdf\">Teacher Rubric</a>  This form is for those who choose option 3 for meeting the praxis requirement. It is important to note that this portfolio only meets the praxis requirement, and not the coursework requirement.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certification%20-%20School%20Psychologist%20Certificate%20Requirements%20%28093%29%20-%209.1.2024.pdf\">093 School Psychologist Application Packet</a>  This packet is for those applying for the 093 endorsement only.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Librarian%20Preparation%20Standards%20Outline.docx\">Library 071 Portfolio Rubric</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span> This document provides the guidelines for library portfolio requirement.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Mentorship%20Guidelines.doc\">Mentorship Guidelines</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span> This document provides the guidelines for Administrator Mentorship.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"resources\">\r\n<h2>Resources</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certification%20-%202026-2027%20Shortage%20Report%20-%209.2.2026.pdf\">2026-2027 Shortage Report</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/How%20to%20Find%20and%20Manage%20Renewal%20List%20for%20Support%20Chairs.pdf\">How to Manage Renewal List for Chairpersons</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/How%20to%20Recommend%20for%20Chairperson19_20.pdf\">How to Submit Recommendations for Chairpersons</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Superintendents%20-%20How%20to%20Assign%20Support%20Chairs.pdf\">How to Assign Chairpersons for Superintendents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Superintendents%20-%20How%20to%20View%20CHRC%20Violation.pdf\">How to View CHRC Violation List for Superintendents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certficiation%20-%20How%20to%20Best%20Support%20Educators%20with%20Certification%20Presentation%20-%206.8.2022.pdf\">How Best to Support Educators with Certification</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["2 section headers — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"4 links on this page open a file — 3 Word, 1 Excel — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"4 links"},{"id":"itemdash","on":true,"label":"Drop the dash once the link is set apart","why":"7 of those items separate the link from its description with a dash. The link is now set in the display face at a larger size with a chevron after it, so the dash marks a boundary that is already unmistakable. Only the separator is removed — no word changes.","value":"7 separators"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"7 list items open with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"7 items"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Certification & Credentialing\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /cert."}],"mechanical":["drupal entity attrs stripped: 28","action links marked: 7"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/cert/authority","title":"Certification - Forms & Resources ","changed":"2026-09-02T22:19:30+00:00","words":194,"bytes":4864,"fixes":["drupal entity attrs stripped: 28","action links marked: 7"],"flags":[],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":2,"t":"Forms","bh":true},{"l":2,"t":"Resources","bh":true}],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":4,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":0,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":2,"videos":0,"images":0,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":0,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":0},"links":{"internal":[],"files":["/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Approved%20Program%20Template.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Waiver%20Affidavit.docx","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certification%20-%202025-2026%20Certificate%20Endorsement%20List%20.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Certification%20-%20Blank%20Upgrade%20sheet